type: dataset
title: "4d-AS-regular: the classification of 4-dimensional Artin–Schelter regular algebras"
abstract: >-
  A website dedicated to the classification and properties of four-dimensional
  quadratic (Koszul) Artin–Schelter regular algebras, organised around the
  known families and their invariants.
